# The studio's cut-out test: a wall 3 m wide, 2.4 m high, 20 cm thick
mtllib wall.mtl
o wall
v -1.5 0 -0.1
v 1.5 0 -0.1
v 1.5 2.4 -0.1
v -1.5 2.4 -0.1
v -1.5 0 0.1
v 1.5 0 0.1
v 1.5 2.4 0.1
v -1.5 2.4 0.1
vn 0 0 1
vn 0 0 -1
vn 1 0 0
vn -1 0 0
vn 0 1 0
vn 0 -1 0
usemtl wall
f 5//1 6//1 7//1 8//1
f 2//2 1//2 4//2 3//2
f 6//3 2//3 3//3 7//3
f 1//4 5//4 8//4 4//4
f 8//5 7//5 3//5 4//5
f 1//6 2//6 6//6 5//6
